# FindMyDonor — Execution Plan

> **Three goals in one plan:**
> 1. Remove ALL Supabase dead code from the entire project
> 2. Simplify the UI — flat, clean, no shadows/glow/glass
> 3. Execute the remaining items from todo-updated.md (product improvements)

---

## Current State Assessment

### Firebase Migration: ~85% Complete
Firebase is the **active backend**. All routes, auth, DB queries use Firestore + Firebase Auth.
Supabase remnants are dead code: deprecated shims, compat aliases, migration scripts, test stubs.

### UI: Shadow-Heavy / Decorative
100+ shadow-premium / shadow-premium-lg usages, btn-glow, card-lift, glow-blob effects,
glass morphism, brutalist styles, and 10+ duplicate legacy components. Needs flattening.

### Product: Missing Features
Public blood request page, live donor availability, institution CRM, admin panel completeness,
tracking flow fixes, and unnecessary homepage sections.

---

## PHASE 1: Remove All Supabase Dead Code

### 1A. Delete Deprecated Shim Files

