| `backend/src/lib/supabase.ts` | DELETE | Deprecated shim re-exporting firebase. No consumers. |

### 1B. Clean Backward-Compat Aliases in backend/src/lib/serverDb.ts

File: `backend/src/lib/serverDb.ts`
- Line 10: Remove `export const SupabaseUnavailableError = FirebaseUnavailableError;`
- Line 16: Remove `export const getServerSupabase = getDb;`
- Line 26: Remove `export const isSupabaseConfigured = isFirebaseConfigured;`
- Keep: FirebaseUnavailableError, getDb, isFirebaseConfigured, mapProfile, getCollection, getDoc, saveDoc, deleteDoc

Files importing old aliases (must update):
- `backend/routes/requester.ts:228` — catches SupabaseUnavailableError → change to FirebaseUnavailableError

### 1C. Delete Dead Migration/Utility Scripts

| File | Action | Reason |
|------|--------|--------|
| `scripts/backfill_auth_metadata.ts` | DELETE | One-shot Supabase backfill. Migration complete. |
| `scripts/clear_supabase.ts` | DELETE | Wipes Supabase tables. No longer relevant. |
| `scripts/apply_auth_redesign_migration.mjs` | DELETE | DDL migration for Supabase PostgreSQL. Applied. |
| `scripts/migrate-to-firestore.ts` | DELETE or archive | Completed migration script. Historical only. |

### 1D. Remove @supabase/supabase-js and pg from package.json

File: `package.json`
- Remove `"@supabase/supabase-js": "^2.110.2"` from dependencies
- Remove `"pg": "^8.22.0"` from dependencies (PostgreSQL driver, no longer needed)
- Run `npm install` to update lockfile

### 1E. Fix Test Backdoor Pattern (Supabase Stub URL → Clean Flag)

Replace `process.env.VITE_SUPABASE_URL === "https://stub.supabase.co"` with
