1. `backend/middleware/auth.ts` (lines 45-47)
2. `backend/admin-server.ts` (~line 546)
3. `backend/routes/admin.ts` (~line 112)

File: `backend/tests/setup-env.ts`
- Remove lines 18-21 (Supabase stub env vars)
- Keep NODE_ENV = 'test' and TEST_MODE = '1'
- Update comments to reference Firebase

All test files that set VITE_SUPABASE_URL (remove that env var):
- `backend/tests/auth.test.ts`
- `backend/tests/account.test.ts`
