- `backend/tests/matching.test.ts` (update stale comment)

### 1F. Clean backend/helpers/errors.ts

- Line ~84: Keep the regex /supabase_service_role_key/i in sanitizeErrorMessage()
  This is a defensive security pattern, NOT dead code. Keep as-is.

