## PHASE 3: Simplify UI — Remove Shadows, Glow, Glass

### Design System Change

BEFORE: Premium glassmorphism with multi-layer shadows, blood-red glow effects, card lift animations.
AFTER: Clean flat design. Borders for elevation. No decorative shadows.

What stays: color palette, border radius, typography, subtle ambient backgrounds, grid patterns,
functional layout.

What goes:
- shadow-premium, shadow-premium-lg → remove entirely
- btn-glow class → remove entirely
- card-lift class → remove entirely
- glow-blob class → remove entirely
- Custom shadow-[0_...] on buttons → replace with shadow-sm or nothing
- backdrop-blur-xl / backdrop-blur-2xl → remove or reduce to backdrop-blur-sm
- Brutalist styles → remove entirely

### 3A. CSS Changes in src/index.css

Remove these CSS classes entirely:
- .btn-glow and variants (lines 234-251)
- .card-lift (lines 271-277)
- .shadow-premium (lines 280-285)
- .shadow-premium-lg (lines 286-291 and 426-428)
- .glow-blob (lines 294-300)
- .btn-brutalist and all variants (lines 332-396)
- .card-brutalist and .card-brutalist-accent (lines 367-396)
- .nordic-label and .nordic-label-wide (lines 314-330)

Keep: .ambient-bg, .glass (minimal), .subtle-border, .gradient-text, .noise,
.grid-pattern, .shimmer, animations, .blood-drop-gradient, .marquee-mask,
.section-fade-top, .no-scrollbar, .animate-fade-in

### 3B. Global Replacement Patterns

Light theme cards:
  BEFORE: rounded-3xl bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-xl border border-ink-200/80 p-6 shadow-premium
  AFTER:  rounded-3xl bg-white border border-ink-200 p-6

Dark theme cards:
  BEFORE: rounded-2xl border border-ink-800 bg-ink-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl p-4 shadow-premium-lg
  AFTER:  rounded-2xl border border-ink-700 bg-ink-900 p-4

Buttons (primary):
  BEFORE: btn-glow bg-blood-600 text-white shadow-[0_14px_32px_-8px_rgba(244,63,87,0.5)]
  AFTER:  bg-blood-600 text-white hover:bg-blood-700

Decorative blobs:
  BEFORE: <div className="glow-blob h-[500px] w-[500px] bg-blood-400/20 ..." />
  AFTER:  (delete the entire element)

